  "source_sha256": "ef29f10dd697f53460c5a8401515822f2a309bdab9816c87326721ab018634c3",
  "pixel_width": 1224,
  "pages": [
    {
      "image": "page-01.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "e34c1d6548afd6a34c6b4c69cc0392e1207174e695e1ec5f7b682482917f06b9",
      "text": "Wukong Plays\nin the Sand",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-02.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "f98ba620e36b8da0b8d026c4e73472289871ae9dd103239bc8df067dea73cb6a",
      "text": "Wukong had a big plan.\n“A mountain of sand!”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-03.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "d833494e96357df73b4d161cb38ee9d3b2c6170a940476c204ddf7e54778e821",
      "text": "He filled his little bucket.\nDry sand.\nTip! The sand fell flat.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-04.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "9a226fab3072f186ced24026c06479b31da2d86af337e30ff3509384e4f7ecf8",
      "text": "“A hat!” said Pigsy.\n“Try it on?”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-05.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "96a1e41ed19b19d8f101438b03ca2ccabe5ccc323776a9cb025bcdbdc1e50a29",
      "text": "Ao Bing brought some water.\n“Let’s try wet sand.”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-06.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "f2a99cb8493df9f91967b28ad346ed40a6535b1f6d147d7896c90b5bbb72666c",
      "text": "Glug, glug, glug.\n“Oops! Sand soup!”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-07.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "6e635f97254a06a8b1704731ab24e572a37459c25de1700fa7f18e97ae1b686b",
      "text": "Wukong put his bucket down.\n“Mountains are hard to make.”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-08.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "377808ef8fe5ce2298e2b223df1a9c5939f07e319f52a14b6f74318f19882ec3",
      "text": "“One small try?” said Sandy.\nWukong nodded.\n“Dry sand. A little water.”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-09.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "0a20c035dce43f13b6f7e48b5d1f05f15758d0922b7e949c4243bcb362001f7b",
      "text": "They mixed the wet sand.\nThey pressed it.\nIt stuck together.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-10.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "3c8a4ac399755efb9d39132f6f23ef4f557631fe48dd6bcc94afd3eb39673d3a",
      "text": "Scoop, scoop.\nPat, pat, pat.\n“Ready?”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-11.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "bee5ac21921b33ee8a46980b2473ff25b416886a9d72aea62ffe55bb1aa3bbe8",
      "text": "They tipped the bucket.\nThey lifted it slowly.\nA tower stood tall!",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-12.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "5333684e77e28ba5ea891f83aa24f02cf5b14a869ae2673a25383039e876c025",
      "text": "Wukong made a tiny mountain.\nPigsy made a round cake.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-13.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "f9d4d67454d97612ed9ec1b84c6fe161c54b945b1112fa75b07d884be5d4480f",
      "text": "Ao Bing dug a little pool.\nHe poured in water.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-14.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "7cd961f6fb2ed4784f3105c9c7c638088bbc590889398027f648e3d9e9a5032b",
      "text": "“Who lives in this tower?”\nasked Pigsy.\n“A tiny king!” said Wukong.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-15.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "e422d28029c7c5dc9c8cd72fb25a6697545240619796c191c410c0280f3a7fea",
      "text": "They packed the toys away.\nSandy helped brush off sand.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-16.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "91721547cd2a850d515a458b33e41ff2eb963cf0aa3c638027530ee371cbc559",
      "text": "Wukong tipped out his shoe.\n“Look! A mountain came too!”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-17.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "d22637ab6fc3dba430ef0766620f48df979b60ce1dd6eb422e5d1b92cb88016b",
      "text": "Wukong & Friends\nThank you for reading!\nWe hope you and your little reader\nenjoyed this little adventure.\nMore free stories\nphg1024.github.io/wukong-and-friends\nRead, download and print - always free.\nRead more free stories\nIf you enjoyed our stories, you are welcome\nto help the next one grow. Support is optional.\nBuy Me a Coffee\nGitHub Sponsors\nCreated by Peihong Guo\nStories and illustrations made with AI assistance and human editing.\n© 2026 Peihong Guo\nCC BY-NC-ND 4.0 · Attribution · NonCommercial · NoDerivatives\ncreativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-nd/4.0/",
